  "body": "Hi Alberto,\n\nWe exchanged a lot with Laoma2252 on the French forum where he alerted regarding the crash he encounters. I advised him to clean the cache folder, and to try deleting the `options` file, none of those fixed the crash.\n\nSince his mac mini is running under Sequoia, whereas mine is still under Sonoma, I thought the OS version could be the culprit.\nAnd since ART and the queue work don't crash on my computer, I can't really help.\n\nMaybe if you can make a Debug build, I can help Laoma running it with the MacOS debug tool, in order to produce back trace.",
